    "detailed_description": "OUR SOCIAL MEDIA:<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>DON'T FORGET TO ADD THIS GAME TO YOUR WISHLIST:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>MASTERING THE ART OF FALCONRY:</strong><br>Step into the world of Arabian falconry, where dedicated falconers nurture and train their majestic birds of prey. Discover the intricacies of falconry and try out various training techniques. Build a profound bond with your avian companions through regular exercises and expand your knowledge by learning from experienced trainers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/2a21f25b0862a39f30a9aa82ed4a2002.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=606 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/2a21f25b0862a39f30a9aa82ed4a2002.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/2a21f25b0862a39f30a9aa82ed4a2002.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>NURTURING AND ENHANCING YOUR FALCONS:</strong><br>Embrace the responsibility of caring for the health and well-being of your falcons, providing them with proper nutrition and daily attention. Explore opportunities to enrich their lives and enhance their skills, ensuring they thrive under your watchful care.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/41e2df358826348558ed2d9c822400c7.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=606 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/41e2df358826348558ed2d9c822400c7.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/41e2df358826348558ed2d9c822400c7.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>EXPANDING YOUR FALCONRY FAMILY:</strong><br>Embark on a journey to grow your falconry family, cherishing each falcon as a cherished companion with its own unique personality and abilities. Explore diverse regions to connect with these magnificent creatures and welcome them into your falconry family with open arms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/bb9fad9fa7fb2c498eacb3101feed8e3.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=606 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/bb9fad9fa7fb2c498eacb3101feed8e3.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/bb9fad9fa7fb2c498eacb3101feed8e3.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>THRIVING IN FALCONRY CHALLENGES:</strong><br>Compete in thrilling competitions against other falconers from around the world, showcasing the deep bond and mutual respect you share with your falcons. Strive for victory in various challenges and tournaments, while connecting with fellow enthusiasts to exchange strategies and celebrate the beauty of falconry.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/536944ab0235dd4f7ae37d32ab9212fa.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=606 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/536944ab0235dd4f7ae37d32ab9212fa.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/536944ab0235dd4f7ae37d32ab9212fa.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "OUR SOCIAL MEDIA:<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong>DON'T FORGET TO ADD THIS GAME TO YOUR WISHLIST:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>MASTERING THE ART OF FALCONRY:</strong><br>Step into the world of Arabian falconry, where dedicated falconers nurture and train their majestic birds of prey. Discover the intricacies of falconry and try out various training techniques. Build a profound bond with your avian companions through regular exercises and expand your knowledge by learning from experienced trainers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/2a21f25b0862a39f30a9aa82ed4a2002.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=606 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/2a21f25b0862a39f30a9aa82ed4a2002.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/2a21f25b0862a39f30a9aa82ed4a2002.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>NURTURING AND ENHANCING YOUR FALCONS:</strong><br>Embrace the responsibility of caring for the health and well-being of your falcons, providing them with proper nutrition and daily attention. Explore opportunities to enrich their lives and enhance their skills, ensuring they thrive under your watchful care.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/41e2df358826348558ed2d9c822400c7.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=606 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/41e2df358826348558ed2d9c822400c7.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/41e2df358826348558ed2d9c822400c7.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>EXPANDING YOUR FALCONRY FAMILY:</strong><br>Embark on a journey to grow your falconry family, cherishing each falcon as a cherished companion with its own unique personality and abilities. Explore diverse regions to connect with these magnificent creatures and welcome them into your falconry family with open arms.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/bb9fad9fa7fb2c498eacb3101feed8e3.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=606 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/bb9fad9fa7fb2c498eacb3101feed8e3.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/bb9fad9fa7fb2c498eacb3101feed8e3.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>THRIVING IN FALCONRY CHALLENGES:</strong><br>Compete in thrilling competitions against other falconers from around the world, showcasing the deep bond and mutual respect you share with your falcons. Strive for victory in various challenges and tournaments, while connecting with fellow enthusiasts to exchange strategies and celebrate the beauty of falconry.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/536944ab0235dd4f7ae37d32ab9212fa.poster.avif?t=1746076875\" width=606 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/536944ab0235dd4f7ae37d32ab9212fa.webm?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904060/extras/536944ab0235dd4f7ae37d32ab9212fa.mp4?t=1746076875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
